  "details": "I propose adding the ability for group instance creators to control which types of VRChat accounts can join their instances—without requiring a VRC+ subscription. This feature would give group leaders better moderation and safety tools, particularly when managing public or semi-public spaces.\n\nSpecifically, the instance creator should be able to toggle access for the following trust levels:\n\nVisitors\n\nNew Users\n\nUsers\n\nKnown Users\n\nTrusted Users\n\nBenefits:\n\nEnhances safety by filtering out potentially malicious or disruptive users.\n\nGives group creators more control over their community spaces.\n\nReduces reliance on external moderation or kick/ban tools.\n\nEncourages more users to host events and gatherings confidently.\n\nI've also created a visual mockup to show how this interface could look, demonstrating how easy and intuitive it would be to implement.",
